{"id": "idaho-4", "headline": "Boise Bench shop makes plant-based soap by hand", "source": "KIVI", "url": "https://www.kivitv.com/boise-bench/boises-mathair-earth-crafts-handmade-soap-and-skincare-using-plant-based-ingredients", "published": "2026-11-23", "url_verified": true, "pages": ["Mathair Earth on the Boise Bench makes soap, body care and skincare by hand. Founded by a mother in 2009, it is now run with her daughters, who grew up watching her make soap at home. Co-owner Mariah Stricklin says the products are plant-based and cruelty free, with ingredients such as kombucha, goat milk and beer. About 95% of what the shop carries is made in Idaho by the family. The storefront at 2436 W. Overland Rd. is open Tuesdays, Thursdays and Saturdays, and products are sold online. Source: KIVI."], "qr": {"n": 41, "rows": ["11111110011000110001000101111011101111111", "10000010100010011110110110110000001000001", "10111010111100111100000110100101101011101", "10111010011011010010001000110011001011101", "10111010111011001010000100010110001011101", "10000010110001100101000011011111101000001", "11111110101010101010101010101010101111111", "00000000111100100100010000100101100000000", "11010011011001110011010111101001101110110", "01100001100000001000110011001100101000011", "11101011111010001101001001101011100101110", "11111101000110100001110111100011000100110", "00001010011000000100111101001100111001011", "00010100001100011011111010000111110001000", "01011011001101100100000101001010111011011", "10110000101101010111111101001111001011010", "01110111111010000101111010011100000101010", "01100100100111001000001110101000011101111", "10001110000010100000100010000110010100111", "01111001110010110100010000011100010001001", "10101111011010011001010111111001011101101", "11000100111111111110110011001000111100101", "11101011001111010001010011001101011010110", "11001001111111101011011101010010111000110", "10110011001111011100111011011101111101000", "00001101110011101101101010000101110000010", "01